      "writtenOn": "2021-09-24T16:44:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is not allowed to sleep from inside an Android hook. The FIPS self-test is too big too disallow sleeping for the entire duration of the FIPS self-test. Consider introducing a new \u0027vop\u0027 instead of using an Android hook.",
      "revId": "6613b8353bd9736a4a07e666199634bafaa2d7db",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "58784e22_efae134c",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1137063
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-09-24T16:50:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Aren\u0027t \"restricted vendor hooks\" (trace_android_rvh instead of trace_android_vh) allowed to sleep?  I thought that\u0027s the point of them.\n\nPreviously, the kernel team has discouraged adding Android-specific functions to struct ufs_hba_variant_ops and instead recommended using vendor hooks (or restricted vendor hooks).",
      "parentUuid": "8a78d34b_6d5e6066",
      "revId": "6613b8353bd9736a4a07e666199634bafaa2d7db",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "55109a2e_c42bdaf3",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1590141
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-09-24T18:17:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Restricted vendor hooks are allowed to sleep.",
      "parentUuid": "58784e22_efae134c",
      "revId": "6613b8353bd9736a4a07e666199634bafaa2d7db",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "28ea2df7_418b30cb",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1869780
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-09-24T18:21:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, I had overlooked that this is a restricted vendor hook. However, restricted vendor hooks have a severe disadvantage, namely that these cannot be unregistered.",
      "parentUuid": "55109a2e_c42bdaf3",
      "revId": "6613b8353bd9736a4a07e666199634bafaa2d7db",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4a8e46f9_7b55fdc5",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1590141
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-09-24T18:25:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we have a scenario where we would need to unregister it?",
      "parentUuid": "28ea2df7_418b30cb",
      "revId": "6613b8353bd9736a4a07e666199634bafaa2d7db",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7536a929_57b5fa8e",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1869780
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-09-24T18:45:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since the FIPS certification code has been implemented as a kernel module, that kernel module can be unloaded. Hooks registered by a kernel module must be unregistered before that module is unloaded.",
      "parentUuid": "4a8e46f9_7b55fdc5",
      "revId": "6613b8353bd9736a4a07e666199634bafaa2d7db",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5a128fd5_cf587db7",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1590141
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-09-24T19:13:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The registration for the hook is done within the core UFS driver. There already exists registration for a restricted vendor hook within it.",
      "parentUuid": "7536a929_57b5fa8e",
      "revId": "6613b8353bd9736a4a07e666199634bafaa2d7db",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
