      "writtenOn": "2021-09-24T20:24:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My understanding is that there is no requirement that vendor kernel modules be unloadable on Android.  Any upstreamed kernel modules need to be unloadable and we should aim for that if possible, but in this case it doesn\u0027t appear to be possible while following the kernel team\u0027s requirement that Android-specific functionality be added using vendor hooks.",
      "parentUuid": "5a128fd5_cf587db7",
      "revId": "6613b8353bd9736a4a07e666199634bafaa2d7db",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
